            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, BWANA uchaghora aighu ya mzabibu ghwake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ini BWANA, nuo mlindiri waro; nadaghudunga machi kula ngelo. Nadaghulindia kio na dime eri mndungi useghubonye ilagho jingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siwadie machu ghangi na mbuwa ya mizabibu. Ngera edeeka na minjwa na mtaranganga elwa nayo, kumangu nadaalwa nayo, na kuikora yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia wamaiza wa wandu wapo wikunde wulindiri ghwapo, ndewiche wibonye sere na ini, ee wibonye sere na ini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku ghichagha, kivalwa cha Jakobo chichamanga, wandu wa Israeli wichawona nicha na kubara mbashu, hata wurumwengu ghose ghuchulo ni matunda ghake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwani Mlungu wakabie Israeli seji ukabie iro mbari rerewikabieghe? Angu wabwaghie Israeli seji ubwaghie awo werewibwaghieghe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipimo kwa kipimo, korelueghe nawo na kuwighenja wubarishonyi. Korewiinjireghe kwa makabo ghibirie, sa kwa kiremba chenona cha mashariki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, kaung'a ya wandu wa Israeli ichainjwa kwa chia iyo, na agha ghichakaia ni matunda gha kuinjirwa kaung'a yake iji magho gha milungu ya kighenyi ghainjwa na kusheghwa sa chokaa, na iji madhabahu ra mlungu ghwa waka Ashera, na iro refukira marumba rameria kuinjwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzi ghorekoghe na ngome ghwasighwa mduu, wandu waghukimbirie ghukasighwa sa kireti; aho niko ng'ombe rilishwagha, radadima aho na kukonua mbashu ra midi yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midi yaro ikaoma, yachika na waka wacha na kuishoa mbande na kurikora. Wandu awa ndewitambukilwagha; kwa huwo Muumbi wawo ndechaawifuya wughoma hata ndechaawibonyera wudawirio ghungi anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, BWANA uchachana na kuela wandu wake sa ngano, kufuma Moda ghwa Eufrate hata kamoda ka Misri; nenyo mchakwanywa umweri umweri, ee wandu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngelo iyo tarumbeta mbaa ichakabwa, na awo werelagharieghe isanga ja Ashuru, na awo werewingiloghe cha isanga ja Misri, wichacha kumtasa BWANA aighu ya mghondi ghuelie Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
